# issue: 563
# red_on: 2026-08-29, pre-fix build: the bm25 scan cap (limit 2 x 4 = 8 rows) fed count() only the capped window, so total was 8, not 20.
# notes: Count all 20 matching chunks despite limit 2 and its 8-row scan cap.
# notes: Text frequency decreases from 20 to 1, avoiding BM25 ties. Rust twin:
# notes: bm25_ordered_aggregate_counts_all_matches_not_the_capped_scan (crates/omnigraph/tests/search.rs).

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Chunk {
    slug: String @key
    text: String @index
}

